msgstr "{{count}}+ वीडियो — कितने लेने हैं, चुनें"

#. Plural form "other" for hi: used for counts like 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7.
msgctxt "notifications.quickDownload.chooseHowMany_other"
msgid "{{count}}+ videos — choose how many"
msgstr "{{count}}+ वीडियो — कितने लेने हैं, चुनें"

msgctxt "notifications.quickDownload.failed"
